# Source SFX pack: 303MB of raw WAV/MP3 originals.
# Only the converted, web-ready mp3s in client/public/sfx-library/ ship.
# Keeping this out of the build context (there is no .dockerignore otherwise,
# so COPY . . would bake all 303MB into the image).
Social SFX Pack - Collection 1/
.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
*.log
.env*
.claude
.agents

ML_Dataset/
ML_Models/
_to_delete/
Claude outputs/
# The client imports the design system's stylesheet and core components
# from OUTSIDE client/ (client/src/index.css, client/src/designSystem.js), so
# exactly those parts must reach the build; the rest (logo explorations, the
# bundle, previews) stays out.
Vibed Design System/*
!Vibed Design System/styles.css
!Vibed Design System/tokens
!Vibed Design System/fonts
!Vibed Design System/components
Vibed Design System/components/*
!Vibed Design System/components/core
vibed-design-extracted/
*.zip
silent_video.mp4
output.mp4
tests/

# Generated edit previews and test renders are not needed in the deploy image.
artifacts/
client/dist/

